    "notes": [
      "Upper / Lower, four days: every muscle is trained twice a week.",
      "Same lifting as for muscle, with shorter rests. The fat loss comes from eating, the lifting keeps your muscle.",
      "Extra sets for glutes, and it is the last thing to be cut when time is short.",
      "Knee: nothing risky for it is in the plan, and gentler options were picked first.",
      "Trimmed to fit 45 minutes: the most important lifts stayed.",
      "Nothing for leg extension suits your knee, so it is left out.",
      "Weights go up by themselves: reach the top of the rep range on every set and next time adds one step. Every 6th week is a lighter deload week."
